<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">How to Download Vimeo Videos in HD</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Vimeo is known for high-quality, creative videos. Many creators use Vimeo to host films, portfolios, music videos, and professional content. This guide explains how to download Vimeo videos legally and in the best available quality.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Check the video's download permissions</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Vimeo creators can enable or disable downloads for their videos. If a video has a download button on Vimeo itself, the creator has allowed downloads. For other videos, you need to contact the owner for permission.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">How to download an allowed Vimeo video</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Open the Vimeo video page and copy the URL from the address bar.</li>
        <li>Go to <a href="/" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline"><%= siteTitle %></a>.</li>
        <li>Paste the URL and click <strong>Get Video</strong>.</li>
        <li>Select the highest quality MP4 available (HD or 4K if offered).</li>
        <li>Click to start the download.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Choosing the right quality</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Vimeo often provides multiple resolutions. 1080p is great for most screens. 4K is ideal if you have a compatible device and want maximum detail. Larger files take longer to download and use more storage.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">What if Vimeo blocks the download?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Some Vimeo videos are protected by passwords, domain restrictions, or privacy settings. In those cases, you must use the access the creator provided. Cloud server IPs may also be blocked; providing cookies or a proxy may help for videos you own.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Is Vimeo download free?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Downloading is free for videos where the creator has enabled it. You do not need a Vimeo account for those downloads.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Can I download Vimeo On Demand movies?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">No. Paid or rental videos are DRM-protected and cannot be downloaded without authorization.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">What format should I choose?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">MP4 is the most compatible format and works on almost all devices and players.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
